  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行连续九天开展隔夜逆回购，每天最多一万亿元",
  "title_en": "China's central bank to run overnight reverse repos for nine working days in a row, up to 1 trillion yuan a day",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月20日，中国人民银行发布公告：从10月21日到11月2日，央行将连续开展隔夜逆回购操作，每天的规模不超过1万亿元。这次操作采用固定利率、数量招标的方式。",
      "en": "On October 20, the People's Bank of China issued a notice: from October 21 to November 2, the central bank will carry out overnight reverse repo operations continuously, with no more than 1 trillion yuan per day. The operations will use a fixed rate with quantity bidding."
    },
    {
      "zh": "逆回购是央行向银行借出资金的一种方法。\"隔夜\"的意思是钱只借一天，第二天就要还。央行表示，这样做是为了更好地满足银行短期的资金需要。",
      "en": "A reverse repo is a way for the central bank to lend money to banks. \"Overnight\" means the money is lent for only one day and must be paid back the next day. The central bank said it is doing this to better meet banks' short-term funding needs."
    },
    {
      "zh": "目前市场上的隔夜利率大约是1.26%，低于7天逆回购利率1.4%。",
      "en": "The market overnight rate is currently about 1.26%, lower than the 1.4% seven-day reverse repo rate."
    },
    {
      "zh": "另外，央行行长潘功胜10月19日表示，央行将研究把公开市场主要操作的期限从7天改为隔夜。如果这样做，隔夜利率可能成为新的主要政策利率，这对中国的货币政策有重要影响。",
      "en": "In addition, central bank governor Pan Gongsheng said on October 19 that the bank will study changing the term of its main open market operations from 7 days to overnight. If this happens, the overnight rate could become the new main policy rate, which would have an important effect on China's monetary policy."
    }
  ],
